{"id":"451bab4ec81f7acd","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-fibrewise-small-limits.md","title":"纤维小极限的积与等化子判别","display":"thm-fibrewise-small-limits — 纤维小极限的积与等化子判别","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-fibrewise-small-limits","aliases":["16-thm-fibrewise-small-limits","16-thm-completeness-int","16-thm--completeness-int"],"display":"thm-fibrewise-small-limits — 纤维小极限的积与等化子判别","depends_on":["[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]"],"source":"Standard product-equalizer construction; fibred limits discussed in §1.8; explicit local proof","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-fibrewise-small-limits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-fibrewise-small-limits</span><span>16-thm-completeness-int</span><span>16-thm--completeness-int</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fibrewise-small-limits — 纤维小极限的积与等化子判别"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3d8e252a3a45dba\" href=\"?note=d3d8e252a3a45dba\" title=\"16-df-fibre-finite-limits\">16-df-fibre-finite-limits</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Standard product-equalizer construction; fibred limits discussed in §1.8; explicit local proof"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化。固定Grothendieck宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，小指标范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 满足其对象、态射集属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>。极限锥 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimCone}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimCone}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a> 中的通用锥泛性质，不加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 有限的限制。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 是函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*D,u^*\\lambda\">\\(u^*D,u^*\\lambda\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3d8e252a3a45dba\" href=\"?note=d3d8e252a3a45dba\" title=\"16-df-fibre-finite-limits\">16-df-fibre-finite-limits</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(S\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Disc}(S)\">\\(\\mathbf{Disc}(S)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Par}\">\\(\\mathbf{Par}\\)</span> 在下式按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 的六元组编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 在各自带下标的箭头集上取源、靶分量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\mathcal K)\">\\(\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\mathcal K)\\)</span> 如下定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> 是以公式指定的一类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴，不作为真类对象量化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)\">\\(u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的所示顶点上的锥分量族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibSmallLim},\\mathrm{FibProd},\\mathrm{FibEqualizer}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibSmallLim},\\mathrm{FibProd},\\mathrm{FibEqualizer}\\)</span> 是下文定义的纤维极限与保持性谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nM_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x,0\\rangle\\mid x\\in S\\},\\\\\ns_S\\langle x,x,0\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\nt_S\\langle x,x,0\\rangle\\coloneqq x,\\\\\ne_S(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle x,x,0\\rangle,\\\\\nc_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(e_S(x),e_S(x)),e_S(x)\\rangle\\mid x\\in S\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{Disc}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S,M_S,s_S,t_S,e_S,c_S\\rangle,\\\\\nO_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\\\\nM_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,0,0\\rangle,\\langle1,1,0\\rangle,\\langle0,1,1\\rangle,\\langle0,1,2\\rangle\\},\\\\\ns_P\\langle x,y,i\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq x,\\qquad t_P\\langle x,y,i\\rangle\\coloneqq y,\\\\\ne_P(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle x,x,0\\rangle\\quad(x\\in O_P),\\\\\nc_P&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle(e_P(t_Pf),f),f\\rangle\\mid f\\in M_P\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle(f,e_P(s_Pf)),f\\rangle\\mid f\\in M_P\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{Par}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_P,M_P,s_P,t_P,e_P,c_P\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Disc}(S))&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Par}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nM_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x,0\\rangle\\mid x\\in S\\},\\\\\ns_S\\langle x,x,0\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\nt_S\\langle x,x,0\\rangle\\coloneqq x,\\\\\ne_S(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle x,x,0\\rangle,\\\\\nc_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(e_S(x),e_S(x)),e_S(x)\\rangle\\mid x\\in S\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{Disc}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S,M_S,s_S,t_S,e_S,c_S\\rangle,\\\\\nO_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\\\\nM_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,0,0\\rangle,\\langle1,1,0\\rangle,\\langle0,1,1\\rangle,\\langle0,1,2\\rangle\\},\\\\\ns_P\\langle x,y,i\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq x,\\qquad t_P\\langle x,y,i\\rangle\\coloneqq y,\\\\\ne_P(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle x,x,0\\rangle\\quad(x\\in O_P),\\\\\nc_P&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle(e_P(t_Pf),f),f\\rangle\\mid f\\in M_P\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle(f,e_P(s_Pf)),f\\rangle\\mid f\\in M_P\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{Par}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_P,M_P,s_P,t_P,e_P,c_P\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Disc}(S))&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Par}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall K\\in\\mathcal K)(\\forall D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I)\n(\\exists L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)(\\exists\\lambda\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}K}\\mathcal E_I(L,Dk))\\ \\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_I}(D;L,\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))(\\forall K\\in\\mathcal K)(\\forall D:K\\to\\mathcal E_J)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\forall L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)(\\forall\\lambda\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}K}\\mathcal E_J(L,Dk))\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}(D;L,\\lambda)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_I}(u^*D;u^*L,u^*\\lambda)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibSmallLim}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\{K\\mid\\mathrm{Cat}(K)\\land\\operatorname{Ob}K\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\operatorname{Mor}K\\in\\mathcal U\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibProd}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\{\\mathbf{Disc}(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathcal U\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibEqualizer}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\{\\mathbf{Par}\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibSmallLim}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FibProd}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibEqualizer}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall K\\in\\mathcal K)(\\forall D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I)\n(\\exists L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)(\\exists\\lambda\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}K}\\mathcal E_I(L,Dk))\\ \\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_I}(D;L,\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))(\\forall K\\in\\mathcal K)(\\forall D:K\\to\\mathcal E_J)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\forall L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)(\\forall\\lambda\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}K}\\mathcal E_J(L,Dk))\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}(D;L,\\lambda)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_I}(u^*D;u^*L,u^*\\lambda)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibSmallLim}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\{K\\mid\\mathrm{Cat}(K)\\land\\operatorname{Ob}K\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\operatorname{Mor}K\\in\\mathcal U\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibProd}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\{\\mathbf{Disc}(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathcal U\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibEqualizer}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\{\\mathbf{Par}\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibSmallLim}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FibProd}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibEqualizer}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是一条通用逐纤维极限定理，不是直觉主义逻辑完备性。给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>，在该纤维取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}K}Dk\">\\(P=\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}K}Dk\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\prod_{a:k\\to l}Dl\">\\(Q=\\prod_{a:k\\to l}Dl\\)</span>；两箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\rightrightarrows Q\">\\(P\\rightrightarrows Q\\)</span> 的a分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(a)\\pi_k\">\\(D(a)\\pi_k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_l\">\\(\\pi_l\\)</span>。其等化子即极限。若重索引保持所用积及等化子，便保持这个锥的泛性质。反向由离散图和双平行箭头图是小图立即得到。空指标积给终对象，故也覆盖空范畴。原稿三个谓词均未定义，现正式给出宇宙大小和保持条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"d3d8e252a3a45dba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化。固定Grothendieck宇宙 $\\mathcal U$，小指标范畴 $K$ 满足其对象、态射集属于 $\\mathcal U$。极限锥 $\\mathrm{LimCone}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]] 中的通用锥泛性质，不加 $K$ 有限的限制。$D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 是函子，$u^*D,u^*\\lambda$ 采用 [[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"d3d8e252a3a45dba","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化。固定Grothendieck宇宙 $\\mathcal U$，小指标范畴 $K$ 满足其对象、态射集属于 $\\mathcal U$。极限锥 $\\mathrm{LimCone}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]] 中的通用锥泛性质，不加 $K$ 有限的限制。$D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 是函子，$u^*D,u^*\\lambda$ 采用 [[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\in\\mathcal U$；$\\mathbf{Disc}(S)$ 与 $\\mathbf{Par}$ 在下式按 [[16-df-category]] 的六元组编码；$s,t$ 在各自带下标的箭头集上取源、靶分量。$\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\mathcal K)$ 如下定义，$\\mathcal K$ 是以公式指定的一类 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴，不作为真类对象量化。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimCone}","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"u^*D,u^*\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Disc}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Par}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\mathcal K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibSmallLim},\\mathrm{FibProd},\\mathrm{FibEqualizer}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nM_S&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x,0\\rangle\\mid x\\in S\\},\\\\\ns_S\\langle x,x,0\\rangle&\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\nt_S\\langle x,x,0\\rangle\\coloneqq x,\\\\\ne_S(x)&\\coloneqq\\langle x,x,0\\rangle,\\\\\nc_S&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(e_S(x),e_S(x)),e_S(x)\\rangle\\mid x\\in S\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{Disc}(S)&\\coloneqq\\langle S,M_S,s_S,t_S,e_S,c_S\\rangle,\\\\\nO_P&\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\\\\nM_P&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,0,0\\rangle,\\langle1,1,0\\rangle,\\langle0,1,1\\rangle,\\langle0,1,2\\rangle\\},\\\\\ns_P\\langle x,y,i\\rangle&\\coloneqq x,\\qquad t_P\\langle x,y,i\\rangle\\coloneqq y,\\\\\ne_P(x)&\\coloneqq\\langle x,x,0\\rangle\\quad(x\\in O_P),\\\\\nc_P&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle(e_P(t_Pf),f),f\\rangle\\mid f\\in M_P\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle(f,e_P(s_Pf)),f\\rangle\\mid f\\in M_P\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{Par}&\\coloneqq\\langle O_P,M_P,s_P,t_P,e_P,c_P\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Disc}(S))&\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Par}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall K\\in\\mathcal K)(\\forall D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I)\n(\\exists L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)(\\exists\\lambda\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}K}\\mathcal E_I(L,Dk))\\ \\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_I}(D;L,\\lambda)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))(\\forall K\\in\\mathcal K)(\\forall D:K\\to\\mathcal E_J)\\\\\n&\\qquad(\\forall L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)(\\forall\\lambda\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}K}\\mathcal E_J(L,Dk))\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_J}(D;L,\\lambda)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{LimCone}_{K,\\mathcal E_I}(u^*D;u^*L,u^*\\lambda)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibSmallLim}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\{K\\mid\\mathrm{Cat}(K)\\land\\operatorname{Ob}K\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\operatorname{Mor}K\\in\\mathcal U\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibProd}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\{\\mathbf{Disc}(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathcal U\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibEqualizer}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{FibLim}_{\\mathcal U}(p;\\{\\mathbf{Par}\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibSmallLim}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FibProd}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibEqualizer}(p).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D:K\\to\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}K}Dk","display":false},{"tex":"Q=\\prod_{a:k\\to l}